<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nav"><a href="/">← Home</a></div>
    <h1>Lumen Documentation</h1>
    <p>Moderation, verification, modmail, automod, and custom commands.</p>

    <h2>Setup</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Invite the bot with the <strong>Add to Server</strong> button.</li>
      <li>An owner runs <code>/allow-server</code> with your server ID (whitelist).</li>
      <li>Open the <a href="/login">Dashboard</a>, set Verified Role, Muted Role, and Automod.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Moderation</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Command</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/warn</code></td><td>Warn a user (saved as infraction, DMs if enabled)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/mute</code></td><td>Mute with optional duration (10m, 1h, 1d…)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/unmute</code></td><td>Remove mute</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/kick</code> <code>/ban</code> <code>/softban</code></td><td>Standard moderation (ban supports duration)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/unban</code></td><td>Unban by user ID</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/infractions</code></td><td>View a user's infractions</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/purge</code> <code>/slowmode</code></td><td>Message tools</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h2>Verification</h2>
    <p><code>/verification-message</code> opens a prompt to customize the embed. Users click Verify → enter username → add code to Roblox bio → confirm.</p>

    <h2>Automod</h2>
    <p>Enable in the dashboard. Filters: invites, bad words, websites. Actions: clear, clear+warn, clear+mute, clear+kick, clear+soft, clear+ban. Set ban/mute durations as needed.</p>

    <h2>Custom commands</h2>
    <pre>/customcommand create name:hello response:Hey there!
/customcommand list
/customcommand delete name:hello</pre>
    <p>Members use them as <code>!hello</code> in chat.</p>

    <h2>Obfuscate</h2>
    <p><code>/obfuscate</code> accepts a Lua file or pasted code. Output includes watermark <code>I DONT LIKE WHEN U READ MY CODE</code> and a Prometheus-inspired header.</p>

    <h2>Staff (owners)</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Command</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/servers</code></td><td>List guilds + whitelist status</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/allow-server</code></td><td>Whitelist a server</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/disallow-server</code></td><td>Remove whitelist and leave</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>/dashboard-add</code></td><td>Grant dashboard access</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h2>Modmail</h2>
    <p>Users DM the bot → ticket channel. Staff reply in the channel. <code>/modmail-close</code>, <code>/modmail-ban</code>, <code>/modmail-unban</code>.</p>
  </div>
